<TXSPN>"Class until this late again today... 
{PAUSE ""}
Was Motoki High really that smart a school?
{PAUSE ""}
　Well, someone like <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> wants to go there too, so the smart ones are probably really smart. 
{PAUSE ""}
Huh?"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="2">Harukaaa</STYLE>! Going out at this hour?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"N-</STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="2">!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"What's wrong? Why so surprised..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="2">"N-no, see, I'm on my way back from the hospital. It was closed yesterday, so."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I see..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"S-see you!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\アスファルトダッシュ.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "0" "10000" "PASS"}
